.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rsop 1 "February 2025" "rsop 0.11.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
rsop \- An implementation of the Stateless OpenPGP Command Line Interface using rsop 0.11.0
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrsop\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
An implementation of the Stateless OpenPGP Command Line Interface using rsop 0.11.0
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
rsop\-version(1)
Prints version information
.TP
rsop\-list\-profiles(1)
Emits a list of profiles supported by the identified subcommand
.TP
rsop\-generate\-key(1)
Generates a Secret Key
.TP
rsop\-change\-key\-password(1)
Updates a key\*(Aqs password
.TP
rsop\-revoke\-key(1)
Creates a Revocation Certificate
.TP
rsop\-extract\-cert(1)
Extracts a Certificate from a Secret Key
.TP
rsop\-update\-key(1)
Keep a Secret Key Up\-To\-Date
.TP
rsop\-merge\-certs(1)
Merge OpenPGP Certificates
.TP
rsop\-certify\-userid(1)
Certify OpenPGP Certificate User IDs
.TP
rsop\-validate\-userid(1)
Validate a User ID in an OpenPGP Certificate
.TP
rsop\-sign(1)
Creates Detached Signatures
.TP
rsop\-verify(1)
Verifies Detached Signatures
.TP
rsop\-encrypt(1)
Encrypts a Message
.TP
rsop\-decrypt(1)
Decrypts a Message
.TP
rsop\-inline\-detach(1)
Splits Signatures from an Inline\-Signed Message
.TP
rsop\-inline\-verify(1)
Verifies Inline\-Signed Messages
.TP
rsop\-inline\-sign(1)
Creates Inline\-Signed Messages
.TP
rsop\-armor(1)
Converts binary OpenPGP data to ASCII
.TP
rsop\-dearmor(1)
Converts ASCII OpenPGP data to binary
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.11.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Heiko Schaefer <heiko@schaefer.name>
